<title>UK: Gehe holds 53.61 pct of LLoyds.</title>
<headline>Gehe holds 53.61 pct of LLoyds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>German pharmaceutical group Gehe AG bought 41,197,128 shares of Lloyds Chemists Plc on Monday and now owns 53.61 percent of the British pharmacy chain and wholesaler, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said on Monday.</p>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, acting for Gehe AG and its unit Gehe Invest, said the shares were bought at 525p each.</p>
<p>Earlier on Monday, Gehe said it held over 50 percent of Lloyds Chemists and Lloyds recommended its shareholders to accept the raised and final offer from Gehe.</p>
<p>Gehe beat off British rival Unichem Plc in the takeover battle for Lloyds. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
